<title>USA: Equitable of Iowa sees 1997 net in range.</title>
<headline>Equitable of Iowa sees 1997 net in range.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES, Iowa 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitable of Iowa Cos said it expects to meet Wall Street estimates of operating earnings for 1997 in the range of $3.90 to $4.10 per share.</p>
<p>&quot;We remain confident that year-end results will place operating earnings per share within the $3.90 to $4.10 range currently estimated by analysts,&quot; said Fred Hubbell, chief executive of the insurance and financial services firm.</p>
<p>Equitable on Wednesday reported first quarter operating earnings to $29.9 million, versus $27.7 million a year ago.</p>
<p>Equitable shares were unchanged at 48-7/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
